; Sum the sizes of everything inside a holder
;
; Adds up the size (+3, the bulk) of every record held by the id in A and,
; recursively, of everything held by those. Used to check that an object fits a
; container. B (0 for the size sum, 1 for the weight sum of #R$9CE8) is passed to
; #R$9D00.
;
; A Holder id
; O:A Total, $FF when it overflows
@label=SumHeldBulk
c$9CED PUSH BC          ; B=0: sum sizes, recurse
 $9CEE LD B,$00
@label=SumHeld
*$9CF0 PUSH IX
 $9CF2 PUSH IY
 $9CF4 LD C,$00         ; total
 $9CF6 CALL $9D00       ; IY is kept by #R$9D00
 $9CF9 LD A,C
 $9CFA POP IY
 $9CFC POP IX
 $9CFE POP BC
 $9CFF RET
